		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">Huntingtin Interaction Network</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>http://artemis.mdc-berlin.de/huntington/eingabe.php</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">&lt;&lt;&lt;!!!&lt;&lt;&lt; This repository is no longer available. &gt;&gt;&gt;!!!&gt;&gt;&gt; The main objective of our work is to understand the pathomechanisms of late onset neurodegenerative disorders such as Huntington&#039;s, Parkinson&#039;s, Alzheimer&#039;s and Machado Joseph disease and to develop causal therapies for them. The disease causing proteins of these illnesses have been identified, but their functions in the unaffected organism are mostly unknown. Here, we have developed a strategy combining library and matrix yeast two-hybrid screens to generate a highly connected PPI network for Huntington&#039;s disease (HD).</r3d:description>
